┌─ Keys · ? to close ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│Everywhere                                                                    │
│  tab       next pane/field                                                   │
│  shift+tab previous pane                                                     │
│  ?         this help                                                         │
│  ,         settings                                                          │
│  w         worktrees                                                         │
│  f         filter tree by state                                              │
│  esc       back one level                                                    │
│  q         quit (agents run on)                                              │
│  ctrl+c    quit if not typing                                                │
│  ctrl+↑↓   resize chat                                                       │
│Mouse                                                                         │
│  click     select / focus                                                    │
│  right     node menu                                                         │
│  wheel     scroll                                                            │
│  drag      move node                                                         │
│Org pane                                                                      │
│  ↑↓        move                                                              │
│  ←→        fold / unfold                                                     │
│  enter     open agent pane                                                   │
│  space     give work                                                         │
│↓ more · PgUp/PgDn scroll                                                     │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
